# Files whose changes reach every page. With branch protection's "Require
# review from Code Owners" on, a PR touching any of these can't merge until
# the owner below approves it (docs/pr-review.md). Pages and content don't
# need an owner's approval; any approved review is enough.
#
# On a fork: replace the owner with the developer who maintains the site
# (a GitHub username or @org/team). Later lines win over earlier ones.

